<title>MEXICO: Cifra sets annual dividend 0.75 peso.</title>
<headline>Cifra sets annual dividend 0.75 peso.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican retailer Cifra said in a newspaper advertisement on Friday it will pay stockholders a 0.75 peso dividend after August 1 for each of its 3.2 billion shares.</p>
<p>The company did not give the record date to be eligible for the dividend.</p>
<p>((-- Mexico City newsroom +525 728 7902))</p>
